    <string name="permissions_section_title">Permission Center</string>
    <string name="permissions_section_desc">Open the setup pages below and enable as much as Android allows. These settings matter for usage analysis, updates, notifications, and stable background polling.</string>
    <string name="permissions_section_desc_compact">Only the setup steps that still need a human tap live here.</string>
    <string name="readiness_summary">Background launch on Android is policy- and OEM-dependent. For best reliability, keep notifications on, set battery to unrestricted, and allow any OEM autostart/background protections manually if your phone has them.</string>
