    <string name="oem_fallback_copy">OEM-only manual steps: many phones do not offer a reliable public intent for auto-start, app lock, recent-app pin/lock, or aggressive battery saver exclusion screens. If background launches fail, open this app’s details page and your phone’s vendor battery/startup manager manually, then allow: auto-start, unrestricted battery, background activity, keep-in-recents/lock, and notification display.</string>
